      "writtenOn": "2017-01-11T02:28:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If real devices need this, then we should be supporting this, likely by special casing this on an architecture/cpu feature instead of a random product variable.\n\nAre there actual devices that support the advanced simd instructions (neon, etc) required by the CDD, but would still need this flag?",
