      "writtenOn": "2017-01-11T02:54:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t know.\n\nMy comment was more in the context of documenting the purpose\nof this flag while removing it from Android.mk\nA better place probably would be a README in this\ndirectory, so the info won\u0027t be lost.",
